# Copy to .env.local (it is git-ignored). Used ONLY by `npm run dev` on your computer.
# On the platform you never create this file: secrets go in the portal's Backend card > Environment variables.

# Your portal token, to deploy from your computer with `npm run deploy`.
# You do not type it here: run `npm run login` once and it saves the token in .env.local for you.
# On GitHub the token is NOT a file: add it as a repository secret named PORTAL_TOKEN.
# PORTAL_TOKEN=mds_your_token_here

# The class AI works on the platform by itself. Locally the AI is an offline mock, so you spend nothing.
# To try a real model locally, use your own key (any OpenAI-compatible service) and set all three:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=...
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# AI_MODEL=...
